
<section class="mt-18 bg-gray-100 h-screen">

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto p-6">
        <!-- Profile Card -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md overflow-hidden lg:grid lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-6">

            <!-- Left Section - Profile Picture -->
            <div class="p-6 flex justify-center items-center lg:col-span-1">
                <img class="w-32 h-32 rounded-full border-4 border-indigo-500" src="https://img.freepik.com/free-vector/tiktok-profile-picture-template_742173-4482.jpg?uid=R145808352&ga=GA1.1.769781337.1739777337&semt=ais_hybrid" alt="Profile Picture">
            </div>

            <!-- Right Section - User Info -->
            <div class="space-y-4 p-6 lg:col-span-2">
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-800"><%= @teacher.name %></h2>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-500"><%= @teacher.role.capitalize %></p>
                <p class="text-lg text-gray-500"><%= @teacher.email %></p>

                <div class="text-gray-700">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">About Me</h3>
                    <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Quisque vehicula neque non quam sollicitudin, vel suscipit erat placerat. Integer hendrerit venenatis libero, sed venenatis justo vulputate et.</p>
                </div>

                

                <div class="flex space-x-6 mt-6">
                    <button class= "ml-2 text-blue-800 bg-transparent border border-blue-800 hover:bg-blue-900 hover:text-white focus:ring-4 focus:outline-none focus:ring-blue-200 font-medium rounded-lg text-xs px-3 py-1.5 text-center dark:hover:bg-blue-600 dark:border-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-white dark:focus:ring-blue-800">Edit Profile</button>
                    <button class= "ml-2 text-blue-800 bg-transparent border border-blue-800 hover:bg-blue-900 hover:text-white focus:ring-4 focus:outline-none focus:ring-blue-200 font-medium rounded-lg text-xs px-3 py-1.5 text-center dark:hover:bg-blue-600 dark:border-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-white dark:focus:ring-blue-800">Delete Profile</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>
